{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OVERALL THIS DEMO FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A playtime of between 20 - 40 minutes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A section from the early stages of the full game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sample of the game's combat mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 enemy types and 2 weapons</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063300/extras/9d73278532479f91e3121e98370dc7b7.poster.avif?t=1760104649\" width=606 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063300/extras/9d73278532479f91e3121e98370dc7b7.webm?t=1760104649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063300/extras/9d73278532479f91e3121e98370dc7b7.mp4?t=1760104649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Years after the events of the prequel INDUSTRIA, Nora is stuck in a parallel dimension, far away from home. Trapped between machine-built walls, she survives alone in an abandoned chapel near the coast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just before she can evade the hostile parallel dimension and return home to 1989 East-Berlin, a chain of unforeseen consequences pull her back into the pulsating heart of the artificial intelligence ATLAS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nora soon comes to the realization that she cannot evade her past and must face the haunting responsibility that lies within it \u2013 her involvement in the creation of the uncontrollable A.I.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo lets you explore the Cannery, an early-game level where you will encounter some of the creatures wandering the world of <strong>INDUSTRIA 2</strong> and begin to unravel some of the mysteries that lie ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063300/extras/7a9dd0ed60687f0522162661fc990ecc.poster.avif?t=1760104649\" width=606 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063300/extras/7a9dd0ed60687f0522162661fc990ecc.webm?t=1760104649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063300/extras/7a9dd0ed60687f0522162661fc990ecc.mp4?t=1760104649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4063300?t=1760104649","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063300/4e9595b57224f14f51e9db1964508449a09ab755/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760104649","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063300/c1dc16d12b6d84acd51fde143b8e7af2d66744eb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760104649","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063300/c1dc16d12b6d84acd51fde143b8e7af2d66744eb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760104649","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game contains action sequences in which you fight humans and robots. Sometimes, the game depicts violent moments on these fights, such as dying enemies, dying sounds, blood decals etc."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>OVERALL THIS DEMO FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A playtime of between 20 - 40 minutes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A section from the early stages of the full game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sample of the game's combat mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 enemy types and 2 weapons</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063300/extras/9d73278532479f91e3121e98370dc7b7.poster.avif?t=1760104649\" width=606 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063300/extras/9d73278532479f91e3121e98370dc7b7.webm?t=1760104649\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4063300/extras/9d73278532479f91e3121e98370dc7b7.mp4?t=1760104649\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Years after the events of the prequel INDUSTRIA, Nora is stuck in a parallel dimension, far away from home. Trapped between machine-built walls, she survives alone in an abandoned chapel near the coast.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just before she can evade the hostile parallel dimension and return home to 1989 East-Berlin, a chain of unforeseen consequences pull her back into the pulsating heart of the artificial intelligence ATLAS.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nora soon comes to the realization that she cannot evade her past and must face the haunting responsibility that lies within it \u2013 her involvement in the creation of the uncontrollable A.I.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo lets you explore the Cannery, an early-game level where you will encounter some of the creatures wandering the world of <strong>INDUSTRIA 2</strong> and begin to unravel some of the mysteries that lie ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"te